    [6659]={name="Scarab Trousers",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Escape Through Stealth'. Starts with Volcor in Darkshore. Objective: Escape the Furbolg cave and meet Terenthis in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Escape Through Stealth",lore="All right then... if you're sure, we'll sneak out of here. Let us leave when you're ready. Remember, after you've escaped, meet Terenthis back in Auberdine."},
    [6664]={name="Voodoo Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Jin'Zil's Forest Magic'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Jin'Zil in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Jin'Zil's Forest Magic",lore="So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."},
    [6667]={name="Engineer's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=27,reqLevel=16,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Ziz Fizziks in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Bring Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle's Mechanical Arm to Ziz Fizziks in the Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle",lore="I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."},
    [6669]={name="Sacred Band",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. Starts with Braelyn Firehand in Stonetalon Mountains. Objective: Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6677]={name="Spellcrafter Wand",quality=2,ilvl=26,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Retrieval for Mauren'. Starts with Collin Mauren in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring 8 Crystalized Scales to Collin Mauren in Stormwind.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Retrieval for Mauren",lore="Travelers keep asking me about the Stonetalon Mountains. It seems to be a popular place for adventure--it doesn't matter if you're seeking wyvern, elementals, or you have business with the Venture Co."},
    [6678]={name="Band of Elven Grace",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. Starts with Sentinel Thenysil in Darnassus. Objective: Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
    [6682]={name="Death Speaker Robes",quality=3,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Death Speaker Jargba.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Death Speaker Jargba"},
    [6685]={name="Death Speaker Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=27,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Death Speaker Jargba.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Death Speaker Jargba"},
    [6691]={name="Swinetusk Shank",quality=3,ilvl=35,reqLevel=30,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Agathelos the Raging.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Agathelos the Raging"},
    [6695]={name="Stygian Bone Amulet",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6697]={name="Batwing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Blind Hunter.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",npc="Blind Hunter"},
    [6713]={name="Ripped Pants",quality=1,ilvl=5,reqLevel=1,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Zureetha Fargaze in Durotar. Objective: Bring the Burning Blade Medallion to Zureetha Fargaze, outside The Den.",zone="Durotar",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [6726]={name="Razzeric's Customized Seatbelt",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Safety First'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shreev in Thousand Needles. Objective: Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Safety First",lore="There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."},
    [6729]={name="Fizzle's Zippy Lighter",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'News for Fizzle'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Martek the Exiled in Thousand Needles. Objective: Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="News for Fizzle",lore="Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons."},
    [6743]={name="Sustaining Ring",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=10,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Knowledge in the Deeps'. Starts with Gerrig Bonegrip in Ironforge. Objective: Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Knowledge in the Deeps",lore="As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."},
    [6750]={name="Snake Hoop",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=22,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Willix the Importer'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Razorfen Kraul",questName="Willix the Importer",lore="At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."},
    [6774]={name="Uthek's Finger",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."},
    [6780]={name="Lilac Sash",quality=2,ilvl=36,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Melkins in Desolace. Objective: Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
    [6789]={name="Ceremonial Centaur Blanket",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Khan Hratha'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Uthek the Wise in Desolace. Objective: Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village.",zone="Desolace",questName="Khan Hratha",lore="But to blow the horn, you need a mouthpiece. To get a mouthpiece, kill Maraudine centaur."},
